{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52492","headline":"赞观音势至二菩萨（题拟） · 释岸","name":"赞观音势至二菩萨（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观音助远接，势至辅遥迎。\n宝瓶冠上显，化佛顶前明。\n俱游十方刹，持华候九生。\n愿以慈悲手，提奖共西行。\n（《宋高僧传》卷十八《唐岸禅师传》，宋王日休《龙舒增广净土文集》卷五作「惟岸」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"释岸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}